1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,433
Tuesday, 6:40 AM. Mia's side of the
bed is empty.

2
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:07,300
Mia? Babe? Her phone is still on the
nightstand.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,367
You open the window. No cars. No
horns. No voices. The whole city is
silent.

4
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:17,600
Day one to year twenty. Fifteen rules.
Fourteen kept me alive. One kept me
human.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,100
I'll tell you the last one at the very
end. Don't skip it.

6
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:27,800
A year ago, a card with fifteen rules
got me out of a subway tunnel. Mia was
waiting on the platform.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,900
Now you're alone in the apartment. And
maybe alone in the world.

8
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:35,333
Okay. Don't run. Don't scream. Knock
first.

9
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:38,700
Rule one. Check every door before you
panic.

10
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:45,567
Fourteen floors. Sixty-one doors. You
knock on every one. Beds unmade.
Coffee still warm. Nobody home.
